From f88c1c5e5fe5176872b1562f84bb3cb6f0a6c8f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SannLab Studio <sannlab@local>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:47:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(sannlab): wallpaper layer behind terminal (image,
 AMOLED, video engine)

Adds the SannLab Studio Phase 1 wallpaper layer:
- activity_termux.xml: FrameLayout layer stack (ImageView, Media3 PlayerView
  with texture_view surface, black overlay view) as first child of the root
  RelativeLayout, strictly behind DrawerLayout/TerminalView. TerminalView
  does not paint a background, so the layer shows through untouched.
- SannLabConfig: parses sannlab.* keys from the standard termux.properties
  (upstream parser whitelists its own keys) and writes them back in place.
- SannLabWallpaper: image mode (downsampled decode, opacity, brightness,
  API 31+ RenderEffect blur), AMOLED pure black base, Media3/ExoPlayer
  video mode (muted, looping, no audio focus, fps selection cap, error
  fallback to still image/black), lifecycle driven from TermuxActivity.
- TermuxActivity: minimal hooks (attach in onCreate, refresh in onResume,
  pause in onStop, release in onDestroy).
